    'guide.sites.d': 'Click a name to explore a site: the previous one leaves. Use {plus} to compare up to three and {check} to remove one. Hover a number to see where the site is and what it is.',
    'guide.sites.touch': 'Tap a name to explore a site: the previous one leaves. Use {plus} to compare up to three and {check} to remove one.',
    'guide.time.t': 'The day, hour by hour',
    'guide.time.d': 'Drag to change the hour (UTC). Each track is a site: top half {sun} when the Sun is in view, bottom half {earth} when Earth is, hatching when the terrain hides them. The date sits just below.',
